# format/fx_expd (id 207): exponent digit placeholder (code 7, arg = 4 jl + type, jl from the left; j = nexp (T3) - 1 - jl).
# Digits of |X| (XR of them remain, T6, set by fx_exp): XR > j + 1 emits extra digits (stay),
# XR = j + 1 its own digit, XR <= j the placeholder ('0', nothing for '#', ' ' for '?').
# Note: fx_emit.md.
